//! Time without a clock (`stdlib.md`: Initial standard-mod catalogue): dates in the proleptic
//! Gregorian calendar, times of day, and instants as nanoseconds since the Unix epoch, with
//! ISO 8601 and RFC 3339 text. All UTC; reading a clock and time zones are not here yet (a clock
//! is a root capability of the runtime).

pub use mod::date::{Date, Weekday, days_in_month, is_leap_year};
pub use mod::instant::{DateTime, TimeOfDay, Timestamp};
